NOT MEDICAL ADVICE

This software produces descriptive summaries of self-tracked measurements.
It is not a medical device and does not diagnose, treat, or prevent any
disease. Its output is not a substitute for evaluation by a qualified health
professional. Reference ranges shipped with this software are population
heuristics for orientation only; where a measurement device or laboratory
supplies its own reference range, that range takes precedence.
